From f3806c320917b1ca07eea57254a4b5427f09a360 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:29:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add the elevator example server mod and API level 8

The elevator is a Rust port of ElevatorMod (MIT) as a WebAssembly server mod
(api 0.3), with eight test scripts. API level 8 adds world.get-collision and
the player-control interface (get-motion, teleport, take-xp, play-sound);
cargo horizon-mod test understands motion, teleports, xp-taken and sounds.
